        "title": "Duo paket + Zdravi Deserti - HT Promo",
        "body_html": "<ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0 auto; max-width: 600px;\">\n<li style=\"margin: 15px 0px; padding: 15px; background: white; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) 0px 4px 15px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(44, 62, 80);\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li style=\"list-style-type: none;\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold;\">\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>2x Risotto Napoletana s Piletinom<br></strong></span></h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>2x WrapMe Piletina</strong></span><br>\n</h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>2x Mongolsko meso</strong></span></h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>2x Pileća Prsa s rižom i grašak &amp; mrkva</strong></span></h5>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>2x Salata od piletine s cous-cousom i vinaigrettom (Chef select by Danijel Biro)</strong></span></h5>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<h5><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>+</strong></span></h5>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<h5><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Zdravi Besplatni Deserti</strong></span></h5>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<h5><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>1 x American Protein Cookie</strong></span></h5>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<h5><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>1 x Proteinske kokos kuglice</strong></span></h5>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<h5><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong></strong><strong>2x SnackMe</strong><strong></strong></span></h5>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Upisom HT koda primjenjuje se popust za Gratis deserte</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n</li>\n<li style=\"margin: 15px 0px; padding: 15px; background: white; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) 0px 4px 15px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>Svi obroći imaju uveći udio PROTEINA</strong></span></h6>\n</li>\n<li style=\"margin: 15px 0px; padding: 15px; background: white; border-radius: 15px; box-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1) 0px 4px 15px; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><strong>XL veličina - porcije su 50% veće.</strong></span></h5>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p> </p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></h5>",
